    },
    {
      "id": "player_proud_001_02",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "すぐ次に行かないで。今の一行、ちゃんとチェックを入れよう。",
      "displayText": "Do not jump to the next thing immediately. Let us actually check off this line.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "warm",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "Celebrate a little.",
          "nextId": "player_proud_001_celebrate"
        },
        {
          "label": "Next step.",
          "nextId": "player_proud_001_next"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "player_proud_001_celebrate",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "賛成。小さく祝おう。大げさじゃなくて、ちゃんと。",
      "displayText": "Agreed. Let us celebrate a little. Not dramatically, but properly.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "player_proud_001_03",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "happy",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "player_proud_001_next",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "次に行くんだね。いいよ。でも、今の達成を踏み台扱いしすぎないで。",
      "displayText": "You are moving to the next thing. Okay. But do not treat this accomplishment as only a stepping stone.",
